  "stageId": "main_00-04",
  "title": "Brawl",
  "storyCode": "0-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b4fffffe0de5708a6f96d8a9e3cbc01c627459175b22f6293eb7142ed6e2ca0d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Ace!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Looks like you all made it out alive.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "This isn't the rendezvous point... Why are you here alone?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "They're the ones who escaped from the central area! Don't let them get away!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Tsk, they just keep coming after us!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Team E2, prepare to intercept--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Dobermann, don't get overzealous. Retreating is our top priority!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}! Quick!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "It's not safe here either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "That's right. We still have to press on to the next rendezvous point.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Where's your team?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Where are you rats hiding? Smoke them out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Here they come again!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, please give us your orders.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Just like the good ol' days.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Um, Ace...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Actually, something unexpected has happened.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Doctor... is suffering from amnesia.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "...I see.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "I'm sorry, Ace... But compared to before, a lot has changed.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Is that so? You don't need to apologize to me.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Have the Doctor's commanding capabilities suffered as a result of the amnesia?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "...As sharp as before.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Doctor's decisionmaking is still absolutely reliable. I can promise you this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Very well then. I'll follow the Doctor's orders then.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "What has been lost can be found again.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Right now, there's a more imminent problem on our hands.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "text": "They're over here! Hurry, let's get them! !",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "Are you done chatting yet? I'm going to go crack some skulls!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, please give us your orders.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "text": "Go. Release your inner beast, and let them feel your fangs!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "Doctor! Ace! The enemy is right in front of us!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Move out immediately!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...Got it.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Seize the opportunity to disrupt the enemy's plans.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Understood.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Team E3! Back up Dobermann!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "text": "An ambush?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "Team E3 has been moving undercover this whole time... I see, they've been waiting for us to pincer the enemy.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "When communications are jammed, our teams should operate near the rendezvous point. That way, even if something happens to me or the scout...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "The broader operation can still be carried out. This is my decision-making.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "In other words, Ace, you left your team back at the rendezvous point and came here alone...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "After all, neutralizing threats around the rendezvous point is our top objective.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Of course, prioritizing checking on your status is a big risk. There's no way I could imperil the entire team.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "The whole reason teams exist is to increase tactical efficiency, not the other way around.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "text": "Hah. Let's continue our discussion after we've taken care of Reunion!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Amiya, you're up.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "text": "Understood! I'll back you up with my Arts!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Finally...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, please command Rhodes Island.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
